        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 57233, Georgica Lever by Lever  Mortise Entry Set</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis Omnia made Georgica Lever by Lever Mortise Entry Set features a timeless curved handle and comes with an ornate lever for both the exterior and the interior trim. Exquisitely designed to show off the embellished crests on both the top and the bottom, this entry set will be sure to make an elegant statement. Every inch of it has been expertly finished, from the leaf embellished on the handle to the detailed ridges on the sides. Even the thumbturn for the lock is ornamented. But beauty has not taken the place of safety, because hidden behind the ornate styling is a U.S.A made mortise lock. Choose from panic proof or dummy functions. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-C08PC1_size.gif?v=1704354673\" width=\"400\" heigth=\"307\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Mortise Box Dimensions\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Georgica Entryset: \r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Tough, non rusting materials used throughout. </li>\r\n<li>Mortise case is heavy wrought steel with zinc dichromate finish for corrosion resistance.</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt: Full 1\" solid brass throw with saw-proof insert.</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable armored steel front for beveled conditions.</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass curved lip strike: 4-7/8\" high by 1-1/4\" wide with a 1-1/4\" lip to center. Finished to match trim. Dust box shipped with set.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Omnia Georgica Lever by Lever Mortise Entry Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>1-3/4\" door thickness standard.</li>\r\n<li>Available with either 2-1/2\" or 2-3/4\" backsets.</li>\r\n<li>Outside Handle Plate Length: 14\"</li>\r\n<li>Outside Handle Plate Width: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Inside Plate Length: 14\"</li>\r\n<li>Inside Handle Plate Width: 3\"</li>\r\n<li><b><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/OMN-mortise-handleset-data-sheet.pdf?v=1704262251\" target=\"new\">Omnia Mortise Lockset Dimensions (PDF)</a></b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Handleset:</b> Just for looks, it is used on inactive doors and does not function. Does not latch or lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Panic Proof:</b> Latchbolt operates by knob or lever on the inside and a thumbpiece on the outside. Deadbolt activated by key outside and turnpiece inside. Turning of inside knob or lever will retract both dead-bolt and latchbolt at the same time.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Georgica Lever by Lever Mortise Entry Set",
